  "selection_policy": {
    "priority": ["explicit_customer_preference","current_message_language","recent_conversation_language","public_language_evidence","neutral_fallback"],
    "prohibited_inference": ["location_alone","name_alone","phone_number_alone","presumed_ethnicity"],
    "low_confidence": "CLARIFY_OR_ESCALATE"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Language and script are separate signals.",
    "Romanized Indian-language messages are supported as a script/transliteration condition, not as a separate constitutional language.",
    "Coverage in this registry defines architectural support; it does not by itself prove model-level fluency or production translation quality for every language."
